Lifayela le-batch lakhiwe ngemphumelelo!

Kugcinwe ngalokucondzile ku:
{0}

Bufakazi bekucinisekiswa kwemklamo lobulondvolotiwe:

{0}

Yakha kabusha i-Synix bese uchuba luhlolo lwekucinisekisa ngaphambi kwekukhulula.

Ikhodi yekungena ye-GitHub:

{0}

Ikhodi yakopishelwa ebhodini lekubhala. Khetsa KULUNGILE kuvula i-GitHub, unamatsisele lelikhodi, bese uvuma i-Synix.

Kwetfula ludzaba lwe-GitHub lolusemtsetfweni?

{0}

Cala ngekuhlola lemininingwane lekulelikhasi futsi uciniseke kutsi ayinalo lwati lolungasilo lwakho.

Loku kutawususa loluhlelo ngalokuphelele ku: {0}
Umlandvo wekungeniswa kwe-add-on kanye nemakhophi ekubuyiswa lagcinwe yi-Synix kutawususwa.
I-server backups lephelele iyagcinwa ngaphandle nangabe ukhetse lokunye lokulandzelako.

Sikususe ngalokuphelele yini loko lokulondvolotiwe?

{0}
{1:f}

Emafayela e-server lasebentako angeke ashintjwe.

Synix yakhishwa ngekuphepha yaya ku:

{0}

Ema-password lagciniwe e-Synix kanye nema-webhooks e-Discord angavuselelwa ku-PC lensha ngaleliphasiwedi lekudlulisa. Gcina lelifayela; angeke iphindze itfolakale.

Synix bekutfunyelwe ku:

{0}

Lelifayela alibhalwanga, ngako ligcine endzaweni letsite. Emaphasiwedi lalawulwa nge-Synix kanye nema-webhook e-Discord kungadzinga kutsi aphindze afakwe kulenye i-PC.

Kwenta i-backup ye-{0}?

