Kumahhala ku-backup drive: {4}

Tintfo letinkhulu tingatsatsa sikhatsi lesidze kutsi tihlanganiswe. Lokucinisekiswa kwekugcina lokufinyetiwe kuvame kuba kuncane kunaloko lokubonisiwe.

Asikho sikhala lesenele sekwakha le-backup ngalokuphephile.

