Lifayela: {2}

Emafayela e-server yanyalo atawutsatselwa indzawo. I-Synix itawucala ngekucalisa i-backup bese ibuyisela emafayela lakhona uma kungaphumeleli kubuyisela. Kufakwa kwe Synix lokulondvolotiwe kanye netintfo letisetjentiswako angeke kuguculwe.

Synix wafundza waphindze wahlola lonkhe liphasela:

{0}

Kute umonakalo lowatfolakala, futsi kute emafayela latfunyelwe ku-Internet.

Asikho sikhala lesenele sekukhipha i-Synix.

{0}

Khulula sikhala nobe ukhetse lenye indzawo yekulondvolota, bese uyazama futsi.

